Tracy Morgan, everybody.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.486
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:27.493 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:34.534 line:0%
♪♪

