I guess it's that.

00:03:54.533 --> 00:03:56.736
-Let's not act
like crack don't exist.

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:58.070
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.070 --> 00:03:59.805
My aunt was on crack, man.

00:03:59.805 --> 00:04:01.907
-Oh, well.
-She bought me a Gameboy

00:04:01.907 --> 00:04:03.843
