and then she stole it.

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:05.311
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:07.180
And then she helped me
look for it.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.915
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:10.383
All crackheads do that.

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:13.019
-Well, that's
a lovely Christmas story.

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:14.587
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:17.523
Hey, is it true, speaking of
Christmas, you know, I think

00:04:17.523 --> 00:04:20.626
