pushing women off my lap.

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:42.615
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:45.017
You know I got sciatica!
-Wow.

00:04:45.017 --> 00:04:47.353
Now, how would they know you
have sciatica?

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:49.622
-'Cause I tell them!
-Oh, well, there you go.

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:52.825
-Before I tip them, I tell them
